Bound scripting-addition IPC so a stalled Dock cannot block yabai indefinitely.

Base: https://github.com/asmvik/yabai/commit/dd845723416f5fe92af49fad5ebab00369e07edd
Apply after macos-27.patch.

Use nonblocking connect, complete writes, and a two-second monotonic deadline
shared by connection, request transmission, and completion acknowledgement.
Only use gesture fallback when no connection was established; a request whose
completion is unknown must not trigger a second Space transition.

